-- Tests of l4/lib/escort-day.l4 (MMS-678): what the Hours of Work and Rest
-- Law asks for the worked days every instrument that pays escorting is held
-- against. They sit beside the module and not in it (the client,
-- 2026-10-22). Each instrument's own tests file holds what it pays against
-- these figures.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `escort-day`

§ `בדיקות יום הליווי`

-- A day out from 8:00 to 23:00: 15 hours less §20's three quarters of an
-- hour, 14.25 working hours; one of them after 22:00, so no night work and
-- §2's day is 8; 6.25 hours of overtime, which §16 pays at 2 × 1.25 and
-- 4.25 × 1.5, 8.875 hours of the regular wage.
#ASSERT `the working hours of an escort day` 8 23 EQUALS 14.25
#ASSERT `the overtime of an escort day` 8 23 EQUALS 6.25
#ASSERT `regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 8 23 EQUALS 8.875

-- Back by 21:00: 12.25 working hours, 4.25 over, 5.875 hours' pay.
#ASSERT `regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 8 21 EQUALS 5.875

-- Until midnight two hours fall after 22:00: night work, a day of 7, and
-- 8.25 hours over.
#ASSERT `the overtime of an escort day` 8 24 EQUALS 8.25

-- The same day on his free day: the 8 hours of the law's day at the
-- regular wage, and the 8.875 on top.
#ASSERT `regular hours the law asks for an escort on a free day` 8 23 EQUALS 16.875

-- The night away. Without the night: the first day's 8.875 and the second
-- day's 10 hours less 0.75, 1.25 over at 125%, 1.5625; 10.4375 in all.
-- With it: the 8 hours from 23:00 to 7:00 at 150% more, 22.4375.
#ASSERT `regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 7 17 EQUALS 1.5625
#ASSERT `regular hours section 16 asks for the worked night away` FALSE EQUALS 10.4375
#ASSERT `regular hours section 16 asks for the worked night away` TRUE EQUALS 22.4375

-- The bound most generous to the employer: 45 hours over 52 weeks, 195
-- hours a month; a unit of 0.7% of the month is 1.365 of its hours.
#ASSERT `the most hours a month of section 3's longest week holds` EQUALS 195
#ASSERT `regular hours activity units pay` 1 0.007 195 EQUALS 1.365

-- A substitution hour at 125% of an hour value of the month over 155.88
-- hours: 1.25 hours of a month of 155.88, about 1.56 of a month of 195.
#ASSERT `regular hours substitution hours pay` 1 1.25 155.88 155.88 EQUALS 1.25
#ASSERT `regular hours substitution hours pay` 1 1.25 155.88 195 GREATER THAN 1.56
